{
  "version": 1,
  "about": [
    "The golden fixture for signed join requests (mls/core/src/join_request.rs).",
    "A request to be seated in a group - an open community room's join inbox, or a",
    "rejoin - is signed by the asking device's own Ed25519 key, the key its Peachy",
    "credential binds and its MLS leaf signs with. The admitting device checks the",
    "signature against the key package it fetched to seat the asker, so a member can",
    "only ever ask to seat THEMSELF.",
    "",
    "The signed bytes bind the group, the actor, the device, the time and a 16-byte",
    "nonce. A proof is 89 bytes: 0x01, i64be issued_at, the nonce, the signature.",
    "A verifier honours one for a day and allows 60 seconds of clock skew.",
    "",
    "Verdicts, and the order they are checked in: credential_rejected (the key",
    "package identifies nobody), malformed, identity_mismatch, bad_signature, then the",
    "clock (stale, from_the_future). Signature before clock, so a forger is never told",
    "their request is merely old. Membership comes last: not_a_member is a request",
    "that holds in every other way from a person who holds no leaf in the reader's",
    "own copy of the group, is not the reader's own person, and is not among the",
    "people the reader names as still being added (`pendingActors`). The reader in",
    "these cases holds no copy of any group, so an asker is a member here only when",
    "the case names them: the people the reader itself invited. A",
    "signed ask proves who is asking, never that they belong.",
    "",
    "Seeds, never keys: 0707..07 is the issuer's stand-in, 1111..11 is Ada's phone,",
    "2222..22 is Mallory, a community member forging for Ada, and 0808..08 an issuer",
    "nobody trusts. The clock is pinned: nowUnix 1789516800.",
    "Every case carries exactly one of expect and expectError."
  ],
